msgid "VDLP Bypass CLUT"
msgstr "Koppla förbi VDLP-CLUT"

msgctxt "#30007"
msgid "HiRes CEL Rendering"
msgstr "CEL-rendering med hög upplösning"

msgctxt "#30008"
msgid "MADAM Matrix Engine"
msgstr "MADAM-matrisenhet"

msgctxt "#30020"
msgid "Hide Lightgun Crosshairs"
msgstr "Dölj hårkors för ljuspistol"

msgctxt "#30023"
msgid "CD Speed"
msgstr "CD-hastighet"

msgctxt "#30024"
msgid "Random Number Generator Seed"
msgstr "Frö för slumptalsgenerator"

msgctxt "#30025"
msgid "System"
msgstr "System"

msgctxt "#30026"
msgid ""
"Select system BIOS. Only ROMS present in the system directory are listed. "
"Changes take affect at core start/restart."
msgstr ""
"Välj system-BIOS. Endast ROM:ar som finns i systemmappen visas. Ändringar "
"får effekt när kärnan startas eller startas om."

msgctxt "#30027"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-1 (U)"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-1 (U)"

msgctxt "#30028"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-1 (J)"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-1 (J)"

msgctxt "#30029"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-1 (J) [No RSA]"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-1 (J) [ingen RSA]"

msgctxt "#30030"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-10 (U)"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-10 (U)"

msgctxt "#30031"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-10 (U) [No RSA]"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-10 (U) [ingen RSA]"

msgctxt "#30032"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-10 (E) ANVIL"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-10 (E) ANVIL"

msgctxt "#30033"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-10 (E) ANVIL [No RSA]"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-10 (E) ANVIL [ingen RSA]"

msgctxt "#30034"
msgid "Goldstar GDO-101M"
msgstr "Goldstar GDO-101M"

msgctxt "#30035"
msgid "Sanyo Try IMP-21J"
msgstr "Sanyo Try IMP-21J"

msgctxt "#30036"
msgid "3DO Arcade - SAOT"
msgstr "3DO Arcade – SAOT"

msgctxt "#30037"
msgid ""
"Select 'font rom'. Required by some Japanese games, otherwise optional. Only"
" ROMs present in the system directory are listed. Changes take affect at "
"core start/restart."
msgstr ""
"Välj ”font-ROM”. Krävs av vissa japanska spel, men är i övrigt valfri. "
"Endast ROM:ar som finns i systemmappen visas. Ändringar får effekt när "
"kärnan startas eller startas om."

msgctxt "#30038"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-1 (J) Kanji ROM"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-1 (J) Kanji-ROM"

msgctxt "#30039"
msgid "Panasonic FZ-10 (J) ANVIL Kanji ROM"
msgstr "Panasonic FZ-10 (J) ANVIL Kanji-ROM"

msgctxt "#30040"
msgid ""
"Select the effective CD-ROM read speed. Warning: can expose timing issues in"
" some titles. Particularly above 16x."
msgstr ""
"Välj faktisk läshastighet för CD-ROM. Varning: kan blottlägga tidsproblem i "
"vissa titlar, särskilt över 16x."

msgctxt "#30041"
msgid " 1x - ~150KB/s"
msgstr " 1x – ~150 kB/s"

msgctxt "#30042"
msgid " 2x - ~300KB/s (stock)"
msgstr " 2x – ~300 kB/s (standard)"

msgctxt "#30043"
msgid " 4x - ~600KB/s"
msgstr " 4x – ~600 kB/s"

msgctxt "#30044"
msgid " 8x - ~1200KB/s"
msgstr " 8x – ~1 200 kB/s"

msgctxt "#30045"
msgid "16x - 2400KB/s"
msgstr "16x – 2 400 kB/s"

msgctxt "#30046"
msgid "24x - 3600KB/s"
msgstr "24x – 3 600 kB/s"

msgctxt "#30047"
msgid "32x - 4800KB/s"
msgstr "32x – 4 800 kB/s"

msgctxt "#30048"
msgid ""
"Select the resolution and field rate. NOTE: some EU games require a EU ROM."
msgstr ""
"Välj upplösning och bildfältsfrekvens. OBS: Vissa EU-spel kräver en EU-ROM."

msgctxt "#30049"
msgid "NTSC 320x240@60"
msgstr "NTSC 320×240@60"

msgctxt "#30050"
msgid "PAL1 320x288@50"
msgstr "PAL1 320×288@50"

msgctxt "#30051"
msgid "PAL2 384x288@50"
msgstr "PAL2 384×288@50"

msgctxt "#30052"
msgid ""
"Selects whether NVRAM saves should be created per-game or as a single NVRAM "
"file shared between all games."
msgstr ""
"Välj om NVRAM-sparningar ska skapas per spel eller som en NVRAM-fil som "
"delas mellan alla spel."

msgctxt "#30053"
msgid "Per Game"
msgstr "Per spel"

msgctxt "#30054"
msgid "Shared"
msgstr "Delad"

msgctxt "#30055"
msgid "Select the NVRAM version."
msgstr "Välj NVRAM-version."

msgctxt "#30056"
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgctxt "#30057"
msgid ""
"Select the pixel format to request from the runtime and convert to from the "
"internal 16bpp format. Changes take affect at core start."
msgstr ""
"Välj det bildpunktsformat som ska begäras från körmiljön och konverteras "
"till från det interna formatet 16 bpp. Ändringar får effekt när kärnan "
"startar."

msgctxt "#30058"
msgid ""
"Force 3DO VDLP to bypass the game's CLUT (color lookup table). May result in"
" incorrect colors but faster rendering."
msgstr ""
"Tvinga 3DO VDLP att koppla förbi spelets CLUT (färguppslagstabell). Kan ge "
"felaktiga färger men snabbare rendering."

msgctxt "#30059"
msgid ""
"Enabling this option causes CELs to be rendered at 2x the resolution into a "
"2x output framebuffer, increasing the fidelity of 3D models. Will not affect"
" 2D games. Has a significant performance impact."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet aktiveras renderas CEL:er med dubbla upplösningen till en "
"utmatningsbuffert med dubbel storlek, vilket ökar detaljgraden hos "
"3D-modeller. Påverkar inte 2D-spel. Har betydande prestandapåverkan."

msgctxt "#30060"
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Ljud"

msgctxt "#30061"
msgid ""
"Run the DSP (audio processor) on a separate CPU thread. Improves performance"
" on multi-core systems. !EXPERIMENTAL!"
msgstr ""
"Kör DSP:n (ljudprocessorn) i en separat processortråd. Förbättrar prestandan"
" på flerkärniga system. !EXPERIMENTELLT!"

msgctxt "#30062"
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Inmatning"

msgctxt "#30063"
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of emulated input devices. Certain games, "
"particularly when using >16x CDROM speed and have more than 1 emulated "
"controller, causes content to ignore gamepad input or crash. Setting 'Active"
" Input Devices' to 1 can be workaround for this issue on some titles."
msgstr ""
"Anger maximalt antal emulerade inmatningsenheter. Vissa spel kan ignorera "
"handkontrollsinmatning eller krascha, särskilt med CD-ROM-hastighet över 16x"
" och fler än en emulerad handkontroll. Att ställa in ”Aktiva "
"inmatningsenheter” på 1 kan vara en lösning för vissa titlar."

msgctxt "#30064"
msgid "Hides lightgun crosshairs for all players."
msgstr "Döljer hårkors för ljuspistol för alla spelare."

msgctxt "#30065"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avancerat"

msgctxt "#30066"
msgid ""
"Increase clock speed of the emulated 3DO's 12.5MHz ARM60 CPU. Dramatically "
"improves frame rates in many games, but increases performance requirements "
"and in some cases has no effect (or may cause glitches)."
msgstr ""
"Öka klockfrekvensen för den emulerade 3DO:ns ARM60-processor på 12,5 MHz. "
"Förbättrar bildfrekvensen avsevärt i många spel, men ökar prestandakraven "
"och kan i vissa fall sakna effekt eller orsaka bildfel."

msgctxt "#30067"
msgid ""
"Select the amount of DRAM and VRAM the system has. Only useful for homebrew "
"and non-stock values may cause issues with some official software. Changes "
"take affect at core start/restart. !EXPERIMENTAL!"
msgstr ""
"Välj mängden DRAM och VRAM i systemet. Användbart endast för hemprogram. "
"Icke-standardvärden kan orsaka problem med officiell programvara. Ändringar "
"får effekt när kärnan startas eller startas om. !EXPERIMENTELLT!"

msgctxt "#30068"
msgid "2MB DRAM; 1MB VRAM (stock)"
msgstr "2 MB DRAM; 1 MB VRAM (standard)"

msgctxt "#30069"
msgid "2MB DRAM; 2MB VRAM"
msgstr "2 MB DRAM; 2 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30070"
msgid "4MB DRAM; 1MB VRAM"
msgstr "4 MB DRAM; 1 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30071"
msgid "4MB DRAM; 2MB VRAM"
msgstr "4 MB DRAM; 2 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30072"
msgid "8MB DRAM; 1MB VRAM"
msgstr "8 MB DRAM; 1 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30073"
msgid "8MB DRAM; 2MB VRAM"
msgstr "8 MB DRAM; 2 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30074"
msgid "14MB DRAM; 2MB VRAM"
msgstr "14 MB DRAM; 2 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30075"
msgid "15MB DRAM; 1MB VRAM"
msgstr "15 MB DRAM; 1 MB VRAM"

msgctxt "#30076"
msgid ""
"Select the initial seed for the emulated 3DO random number generators. Fixed"
" seeds provide repeatable behavior for testing. Changes take effect after "
"fully reinitializing the core."
msgstr ""
"Välj ursprungligt frö för de emulerade 3DO-slumptalsgeneratorerna. Fasta "
"frön ger upprepningsbart beteende vid testning. Ändringar får effekt efter "
"att kärnan har initierats om helt."

msgctxt "#30077"
msgid "Random (time-based)"
msgstr "Slumpmässigt (tidsbaserat)"

msgctxt "#30078"
msgid ""
"'MADAM' is the 3DO's graphics accelerator. It contains a custom maths co-"
"processor, used by the 3DO's CPU to offload matrix operations. This "
"corresponds to running in 'Hardware' - but the 3DO could also utilise a "
"built-in ARM 'Software' version of the MADAM matrix engine. 'Hardware' mode "
"is the default, but it has been observed that some games run faster when "
"forcing 'Software' mode. Changes take affect at core start/restart."
msgstr ""
"”MADAM” är 3DO:ns grafikaccelerator. Den innehåller en anpassad matematisk "
"hjälpprocessor som 3DO-processorn använder för att avlasta "
"matrisoperationer. Detta motsvarar läget ”Hårdvara”, men 3DO kan också "
"använda en inbyggd ARM-baserad programvaruversion av MADAM-matrisenheten. "
"Läget ”Hårdvara” är standard, men vissa spel kör snabbare när läget "
"”Programvara” tvingas. Ändringar får effekt när kärnan startas eller startas"
" om."

msgctxt "#30079"
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Hårdvara"

msgctxt "#30080"
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Programvara"

msgctxt "#30081"
msgid ""
"3DO games are built on top of Portfolio OS. Opera has high level emulation "
"of certain OS functions. This HLE may improve performance in on certain "
"games."
msgstr ""
"3DO-spel bygger på Portfolio OS. Opera har högnivåemulering av vissa OS-"
"funktioner. Denna HLE kan förbättra prestandan i vissa spel."

msgctxt "#30082"
msgid ""
"Print 3DO debug port output to stderr. Only really useful to 3DO homebrew "
"developers."
msgstr ""
"Skriv utdata från 3DO:s felsökningsport till stderr. Endast användbart för "
"utvecklare av 3DO-hemprogram."

